# Timing sheet for KD-001. One row per shot:
# start	end	shot	move	caption	audio
#
# The moves are chosen so no two neighbouring shots move the same way - that
# is what keeps a sequence of stills reading as camera work rather than as a
# slideshow. The peak at 0:19 gets the slowest push and the longest hold,
# which is `#peak-gets-time`: a fifth of the runtime on the face that knows
# the answer, while the question comes from off-camera.
